        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Archbold Gymnasium, Archbold Stadium, Carrier Dome\n- People: John Dustin Archbold, John D. Rockefeller\n- Companies: Standard Oil Company\n- Organizations: the university\n\nFacts:\n- John Dustin Archbold's small oil company was bought by John D. Rockefeller's Standard Oil Company.\n- Archbold Gymnasium was built in 1908 with money donated by John Dustin Archbold.\n- John Dustin Archbold was a major benefactor of the university.\n- John Dustin Archbold also funded Archbold Stadium, which stood just west of Archbold Gymnasium.\n- The Carrier Dome now occupies the site of Archbold Stadium.",
